// EXPECT: FAIL
// ERROR_CONTAINS: ANUBIS_CRYPTO_PBKDF2_LENGTH
// RUNTIME: exercise via `anubis run` (this is a runtime panic; `anubis check` still passes,
// this is a *runtime* fail-closed gate).
// SILENT_WRONG closed: `anubis_pbkdf2_hmac_sha256` previously coerced `length <= 0` to 0 via
